<title>CHINA: Housing and Com Bank sets $150 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Housing and Com Bank sets $150 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by bookrunner ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HOUSING AND COMMERCIAL BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$150 MLN  COUPON     3ML+27BP  MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 RE-OFFER  99.95*</p>
<p> PUTS	 ANNUAL	CALLS	ANNUAL    LAUNCH    08.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON	REPAYMENT  BULLET    REPLIES   08.JUL.97</p>
<p> RATING     A1**	  SALES LMTS STANDARD  DENOMS    --</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	   CRS DEF    YES	 FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH     HOME CTRY  S.KOREA   PAY DATE  23.JUL.97</p>
<p> FEES	 8BP SPLIT   MGT/UND    3BP	 SELLING   5BP</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGERS    ABN AMRO HOARE GOVETT (BOOKS), LTCB ASIA</p>
<p>			(BOOKS), MERRILL LYNCH (BOOKS), AND FUJI</p>
<p>			INTERNATIONAL FINANCE (HK)</p>
<p> NOTES   ISSUED OFF THE BANK'S US$1.0 BLN EURO-MTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>	   *REOFFER PRICED TO YIELD LIBOR+32BP TO THE ONE-YEAR PUT</p>
<p>	    OPTION.</p>
<p>	   **ISSUER RATING</p>
<p>	   A GROUP IS BEING FORMED.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
